      "assistant_text": "According to the [[credential-scoping]] page, the Anthropic API key is **injected into the child process environment immediately before the spawned process starts**. Specifically:\n\n1. The Hub process never holds the API key itself\n2. A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n3. The key is then injected **only into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process**, right before that process begins execution\n4. The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated\n\nThe page also notes that the Query agent follows the same model \u2014 it receives the credential injected into its own environment at spawn time, rather than inheriting it from the Hub\u0027s process environment.",
